<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Work With Us · Join Our Team</div>
    <h1>Be part of something that creates impact.</h1>
    <p>
      Have ideas, skills, or a passion for making a difference?
      Join the Impact International Youth team and help us create
      opportunities for young people around the world.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Explore Opportunities</div>
        <h2>Find your place in our team.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        We welcome motivated young people who want to contribute,
        collaborate, and gain experience through meaningful
        youth-led initiatives.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="work-roles">

      <div class="card work-role">
        <div class="card-number">01 / MEDIA & COMMUNICATIONS</div>
        <h3>Media & Communications</h3>
        <p>
          Help shape how the world sees IIY. Contribute to our
          social media, visual content, announcements, website
          communication, and public outreach.
        </p>
        <span class="role-type">Creative · Communication</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card work-role">
        <div class="card-number">02 / PARTNERSHIPS & EXTERNAL RELATIONS</div>
        <h3>Partnerships & External Relations</h3>
        <p>
          Help build connections with organizations, institutions,
          and youth initiatives. Support outreach, collaboration,
          and the development of new partnerships.
        </p>
        <span class="role-type">Outreach · Networking</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card work-role">
        <div class="card-number">03 / YOUTH ENGAGEMENT</div>
        <h3>Youth Engagement</h3>
        <p>
          Help us connect with young people, welcome new members,
          encourage participation, and build an active and
          supportive international community.
        </p>
        <span class="role-type">Community · Leadership</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card work-role">
        <div class="card-number">04 / RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h3>Research & Development</h3>
        <p>
          Contribute ideas, explore important topics, support
          initiative development, and help us improve our
          programs, events, and future projects.
        </p>
        <span class="role-type">Research · Innovation</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">The Experience</div>
        <h2>More than a position.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Being part of IIY means learning by doing, working with
        others, and contributing to something beyond yourself.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">01</div>
        <h3>Recognition</h3>
        <p>
          Receive official certificates in recognition of your
          contributions and involvement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">02</div>
        <h3>Real Experience</h3>
        <p>
          Develop practical skills in teamwork, communication,
          leadership, and organization.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-number">03</div>
        <h3>Global Connections</h3>
        <p>
          Collaborate with young people from different backgrounds
          and contribute to international initiatives.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="work-commitment">
      <div class="eyebrow">Before You Apply</div>
      <h2>A shared commitment.</h2>
      <p>
        All team positions at Impact International Youth are
        voluntary. We are looking for people who are willing to
        contribute their time, skills, and commitment to our work.
        Team members are expected to communicate, collaborate,
        and take responsibility for their assigned tasks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

